    For x64 builds the ljit_*.c files won't link cleanly — Phase 2 of the migration
    needs to either (a) exclude JIT files from the x64 build and ship interpreter-only
    Lua, or (b) port to LuaJIT 2.x which has native x64 DynAsm support.
    Option (a) is the easier path; flag this for Phase 2 attention.
